{"n": 1265, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1265.webp", "text": "6575... REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nOR REPLACING CONTROL\nUNIT FOR BURGLAR ALARM\n\n| Turn holding screws of instrument panel trim\n\nat bottom left 90° and remove trim panel.\n\nDisconnect plugs (1 ...:3).\n\nUnscrew screws and remove control unit.\n\n6575... REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nOR REPLACING CODING LOCK\nFOR BURGLAR ALARM\n\nRemove door trim panel — see 51 41.001,\nPull off plastic sheet partially.\nInstallation:\n\nReplace damaged plastic sheet.\n\nPush back clamp (1).\nPull off plugs (2 and 3).\n\nPull off spring retainer (5) and remove coding\n\nlock (4).\n\nInstallation:\n\n1. Place spring retainer in groove below the\ndiaphragm spring on the coding lock and\nalign that tab faces plug connection of the\n\ndoor wire harness.\n\n2. Assemble plate (1) and liner (2), and insert\nin door pane! (3).\n\n3. Press coding lock against the plate until the\nspring retainer engages.", "words": [["6575...", 0.2619, 0.069, 0.308, 0.0802], ["REMOVING", 0.3247, 0.069, 0.385, 0.0809], ["AND", 0.388, 0.0696, 0.4124, 0.0809], ["INSTALLING", 0.4164, 0.0696, 0.4833, 0.0809], ["OR", 0.3242, 0.0849, 0.3399, 0.0968], ["REPLACING", 0.344, 0.0849, 0.4068, 0.0975], ["CONTROL", 0.4108, 0.0855, 0.4645, 0.0975], ["UNIT", 0.3242, 0.1015, 0.3511, 0.1127], ["FOR", 0.3551, 0.1021, 0.3774, 0.1134], ["BURGLAR", 0.381, 0.1021, 0.4352, 0.1134], ["ALARM", 0.4392, 0.1021, 0.4792, 0.1134], ["|", 0.2487, 0.1432, 0.2503, 0.1466], ["Turn", 0.2614, 0.134, 0.2857, 0.1452], ["holding", 0.2888, 0.134, 0.3252, 0.1472], ["screws", 0.3283, 0.1366, 0.3587, 0.1452], ["of", 0.3617, 0.134, 0.3713, 0.1452], ["instrument", 0.3754, 0.134, 0.4265, 0.1459], ["panel", 0.4301, 0.1346, 0.4549, 0.1479], ["trim", 0.4585, 0.1346, 0.4782, 0.1459], ["at", 0.2594, 0.1446, 0.2715, 0.1678], ["bottom", 0.2756, 0.1446, 0.307, 0.1678], ["left", 0.311, 0.1446, 0.3318, 0.1678], ["90°", 0.3359, 0.1446, 0.3495, 0.1678], ["and", 0.3551, 0.1446, 0.3703, 0.1678], ["remove", 0.37